        <mxCell id="2. 52" value="&lt;b&gt;LeggedRobotDriverROS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;one RobotDriverROS loop; its callback steps&lt;br&gt;the legged server and every limb server&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;RobotDriverUnitreeB1 : LeggedRobotDriver&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;├ leg view (FRONT_RIGHT)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;├ leg view (FRONT_LEFT)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;├ leg view (REAR_RIGHT)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;└ leg view (REAR_LEFT)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;arcSize=8;fillColor=#1ba1e2;fontColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#006EAF;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
