        <mxCell id="4. 32" value="&lt;b&gt;Any exception ends the loop.&lt;/b&gt; A throwing server callback (second publisher), a watchdog failure or a driver error leaves control_loop(); ~RobotDriverROS() then calls deinitialize() and disconnect(): arms released, Move(0, 0, 0), the robot keeps standing. Because every server is in this one loop, the whole robot always stops together." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
